---
title: Not found
description: That page doesn't exist.
permalink: /404.html
---
{#
  Cloudflare Pages (and Netlify, and GitHub Pages) serve /404.html for
  unmatched paths. Without this file, Cloudflare Pages falls back to
  /index.html and returns HTTP 200 — so every mistyped URL silently renders
  the homepage as a "soft 404", which search engines index and users find
  confusing. This file is what makes a missing page actually return 404.
#}
<p>
  That page doesn't exist — it may have moved, or the link may be wrong.
</p>

<p>
  Try the <a href="{{ site.home_path }}">homepage</a> or the
  <a href="{{ site.catalog_path }}">catalogue</a>.
</p>
